@agapay_backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5211

### Health-ish sanity check (rate limiter + CORS warm-up; allow-listed)
GET {{agapay_backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/suspension-status
Accept: application/json

### Login (replace with real credentials; seed demo accounts use @demo.agapay.com)
POST {{agapay_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "someone@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Refresh token (paste the refreshToken returned by login)
POST {{agapay_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Authenticated example (paste the accessToken returned by login)
GET {{agapay_backend_HostAddress}}/api/sessions/me/upcoming
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

###
